WEBVTT

00:00:03.385 --> 00:00:06.565
A dental chain grows by
acquiring practices,

00:00:06.615 --> 00:00:09.705
and each practice comes with
its own software.

00:00:09.755 --> 00:00:13.845
Across Europe, chains and groups
are consolidating fast.

00:00:13.895 --> 00:00:19.945
Comparing quality today means migrating
records, a costly and risky process.

00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:22.625
With Dental Data there is no need.

00:00:22.675 --> 00:00:27.125
A connector is installed next to each
software, and the indicators are computed

00:00:27.175 --> 00:00:32.285
in each practice with the same definition,
based on clinical guidelines.

00:00:32.335 --> 00:00:34.645
Management sees comparable results for the

00:00:34.695 --> 00:00:37.985
whole network, without a
single record moving.

00:00:38.035 --> 00:00:41.225
And the chain can demonstrate its
quality to regulators,

00:00:41.275 --> 00:00:46.045
payers and insurers, ready for the
European Health Data Space.

00:00:46.095 --> 00:00:50.575
Demonstrable quality, without
migrating a single record.
